msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "one or both sessions have no verified quiet segment"
msgstr "一方または両方のセッションに検証済みの無音区間がありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "gain not declared equal"
msgstr "ゲインが同じと宣言されていません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "placement heights are compared only when both results are tier 2"
msgstr "配置の高さは、両方の結果が段階 2 のときだけ比較します"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"ISO 3382-1 quotes a just-noticeable difference for reverberation time of"
" about {jnd_percent:g} % (clause not verified against the standard text)"
". A change is not called significant from a single pair of positions."
msgstr ""
"ISO 3382-1 は残響時間の弁別限をおよそ {jnd_percent:g} % としています（条項は規格本文と照合していません）。位置のペ"
"ア 1 組だけでは変化を有意とは呼びません。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"sample rates differ ({baseline_rate} Hz vs {candidate_rate} Hz); compari"
"son is still allowed"
msgstr "サンプルレートが違います（{baseline_rate} Hz 対 {candidate_rate} Hz）。比較は続けます"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "sweep durations differ ({baseline_s} s vs {candidate_s} s)"
msgstr "スイープ時間が違います（{baseline_s} s 対 {candidate_s} s）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "sweep levels differ ({baseline_dbfs} dBFS vs {candidate_dbfs} dBFS)"
msgstr "スイープレベルが違います（{baseline_dbfs} dBFS 対 {candidate_dbfs} dBFS）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "one or both sides have no number"
msgstr "一方または両方に数値がありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"candidate minus baseline (dB) on a shared log grid inside the common exc"
"itation band"
msgstr "共通の励起帯域内の共有対数グリッド上で、比較対象マイナス基準（dB）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"early reflections are not compared unless both sides have high direct-so"
"und confidence (baseline {baseline_confidence}, candidate {candidate_con"
"fidence})"
msgstr ""
"初期反射は、両方の直接音確度が高いときだけ比較します（基準 {baseline_confidence}、比較対象 {candidate_conf"
"idence}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "frequency-response curves are missing on one or both sides (--no-curves)"
msgstr "一方または両方に周波数特性曲線がありません（--no-curves）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "one or both results have no excitation band, so they cannot be compared"
msgstr "一方または両方の結果に励起帯域がないため比較できません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the excitation bands do not overlap"
msgstr "励起帯域が重なりません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "baseline {validity} ({reason})"
msgstr "基準 {validity}（{reason}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "baseline {validity}"
msgstr "基準 {validity}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidate {validity} ({reason})"
msgstr "比較対象 {validity}（{reason}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidate {validity}"
msgstr "比較対象 {validity}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "metrics are not both VALID"
msgstr "指標が両方とも VALID ではありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "placement lengths are not both VALID"
msgstr "配置の長さが両方とも VALID ではありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"common excitation band {low:g}-{high:g} Hz is {octaves:.2f} octaves, nar"
"rower than the required {required:g} octave"
msgstr ""
"共通励起帯域 {low:g}-{high:g} Hz は {octaves:.2f} オクターブで、必要な {required:g} オクターブ"
"より狭いです"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"RT60 estimate missing on one or both sides (never taken from an invalid "
"metric)"
msgstr "一方または両方に RT60 推定がありません（無効な指標からは取りません）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "band missing from the baseline"
msgstr "基準にそのバンドがありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"path delay is compared only when both results used a compensated loopbac"
"k"
msgstr "経路遅延は、両方の結果が補償済みループバックを使ったときだけ比較します"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "band missing from the candidate"
msgstr "比較対象にそのバンドがありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"ISO 3382-2:2008, 4.3.1, Table 1, read from the standard's preview pages "
"(cdn.standards.iteh.ai sample of ISO 3382-2:2008) on 2026-09-24; footnot"
"es not implemented"
msgstr ""
"ISO 3382-2:2008、4.3.1、表 1。規格のプレビューページ（cdn.standards.iteh.ai の ISO 3382-2"
":2008 見本）を 2026-09-24 に読みました。脚注は実装していません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Decay curves are never averaged; only VALID T values enter the mean."
msgstr "減衰曲線は平均しません。平均に入るのは VALID な T 値だけです。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"ISO 3382-2 class {klass}: {n_source} source position(s), {n_mic} microph"
"one position(s), {combos} source-microphone combination(s) against ISO 3"
"382-2:2008, 4.3.1, Table 1, read from the standard's preview pages (cdn."
"standards.iteh.ai sample of ISO 3382-2:2008) on 2026-09-24; footnotes no"
"t implemented. The class is a label; the other clause 4 conditions (posi"
"tion spacing, distances from surfaces) are not checked."
msgstr ""
"ISO 3382-2 クラス {klass}: 音源位置 {n_source}、マイク位置 {n_mic}、音源–マイク組み合わせ {combo"
"s}。ISO 3382-2:2008、4.3.1、表 1。規格のプレビューページ（cdn.standards.iteh.ai の ISO 338"
"2-2:2008 見本）を 2026-09-24 に読みました。脚注は実装していません。クラスはラベルです。条項 4 の他条件（位置間隔、面から"
"の距離）は見ていません。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no VALID values to average"
msgstr "平均できる VALID な値がありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"Candidates only: a peak in the low-frequency response with a long narrow"
"-band decay may be a room resonance, but room-mode identification is not"
" attempted in v0.1."
msgstr "候補のみ: 低域特性のピークで狭いバンドの減衰が長いものは部屋の共振かもしれません。v0.1 では部屋モードの同定はしません。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the analysed response is {length_s:.2f} s long, so its resolution is {re"
"solution_hz:.1f} Hz and peaks below {low:.0f} Hz cannot be separated"
msgstr ""
"解析した応答は {length_s:.2f} s なので分解能は {resolution_hz:.1f} Hz です。{low:.0f} Hz "
"未満のピークは分離できません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"no part of the resonance range was excited and resolved; no search was m"
"ade"
msgstr "共振範囲のどの部分も励起・分解されておらず、探索はしていません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "frequency resolution is too coarse for the resonance search"
msgstr "周波数分解能が粗く、共振探索には足りません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"some candidates have too few measurable neighbouring bands for the surro"
"undings comparison; their decay is not called distinguishable"
msgstr "一部の候補は周囲比較に使える隣バンドが足りず、減衰を区別できるとは言いません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the search is limited to {low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, the part of the range "
"whose 1/3-octave band lies inside the excited {band_low:.0f}-{band_high:"
".0f} Hz"
msgstr ""
"探索は {low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz に限ります。励起された {band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} H"
"z の内側に 1/3 オクターブバンドが収まる範囲です"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"candidates are envelope peaks standing above the local diffuse level; in"
" a dense early tail some candidates may be statistical rather than discr"
"ete reflections"
msgstr "候補は局所的な拡散レベルより上に立つ包絡線ピークです。密な初期テールでは、離散反射ではなく統計的な候補もあります"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the impulse response ends {analysed_ms:.1f} ms after the direct sound, s"
"o only that part of the {min_ms:.0f}-{max_ms:.0f} ms window could be sea"
"rched"
msgstr ""
"インパルス応答は直接音の {analysed_ms:.1f} ms 後で終わるため、{min_ms:.0f}-{max_ms:.0f} ms 窓"
"のうちその部分だけを探せました"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"impulse response is too short after the direct sound for reflection anal"
"ysis"
msgstr "直接音のあとが短く、反射解析には足りません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only the {count} strongest reflections are listed"
msgstr "最も強い反射 {count} 件だけを載せます"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"direct-sound detection confidence is low; reflection delays are relative"
" to the strongest peak, which may not be the direct sound"
msgstr "直接音検出の確度が低いです。反射遅延は最も強いピーク基準で、それが直接音でない可能性があります"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct sound (time 0 = the detected broadband direct sound)"
msgstr "直接音（時刻 0 = 検出した広帯域の直接音）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"dB re (full-scale sine RMS)^2 per Hz: the power spectral density is scal"
"ed so that 10*log10 of its integral is the reported AES17 RMS level in d"
"BFS"
msgstr ""
"dB re (フルスケール正弦 RMS)^2 / Hz: パワースペクトル密度は、積分の 10*log10 が報告する AES17 RMS（dB"
"FS）になるようスケールしています"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"c = 331.3 * sqrt(1 + T/273.15) m/s (adiabatic ideal-gas relation for dry"
" air; 343.2 m/s at 20 C, numerically equal to the ISO 9613-1 form c = 34"
"3.2 * sqrt(T/293.15))"
msgstr ""
"c = 331.3 * sqrt(1 + T/273.15) m/s（乾燥空気の断熱理想気体。20 C で 343.2 m/s。ISO 9613"
"-1 の c = 343.2 * sqrt(T/293.15) と数値は同じ）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"No coordinate, room length, room width or wall distance is reported. One"
" omnidirectional microphone at one position measures path lengths, not d"
"irections, and the deconvolved time origin contains the interface round-"
"trip latency, so there is no absolute time of flight: the four independe"
"nt arrival equations constrain six unknowns, a deficit of three without "
"a tape-measured loudspeaker-to-microphone distance and two with it. The "
"remaining freedom is the direction of the loudspeaker-to-microphone vect"
"or, and every direction reproduces the measured arrival times exactly. O"
"nly quantities invariant over that family are reported: the product of t"
"he two perpendicular distances to a plane, and the vertical axis once on"
"e perpendicular distance is supplied by the user."
msgstr ""
"座標、部屋の長さ、部屋の幅、壁までの距離は出しません。無指向マイク 1 本・1 位置では経路長は測れても向きは分からず、逆畳み込みの時間原点には"
"インターフェースの往復レイテンシが入り、絶対飛行時間はありません。独立な到着方程式 4 本が未知数 6 個を縛り、巻尺のスピーカー–マイク距離が"
"なければ不足は 3、あれば 2 です。残る自由度はスピーカー–マイクベクトルの向きで、どの向きでも測った到着時刻を正確に再現します。その族で不変"
"な量だけを出します。平面までの 2 つの垂直距離の積と、垂直距離を 1 つ利用者が入れたときの垂直軸です。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"propagated from the stated tape-measure, temperature and peak-location u"
"ncertainties only; it excludes model error (that the reflector is flat, "
"rigid and large compared with the wavelength, that the arrival is a firs"
"t-order specular reflection, and that the user measured to the plane tha"
"t actually reflected), which is usually larger"
msgstr ""
"述べた巻尺・気温・ピーク位置の不確かさだけを伝播します。モデル誤差（反射面が波長に対して平らで剛で大きい、到着が 1 次の鏡面反射、利用者が実際"
"に反射した面を測った）は含みません。そちらがたいてい大きいです"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "relative dB (0 dB = flat loopback of the reference sweep)"
msgstr "相対 dB（0 dB = 参照スイープの平坦なループバック）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "uncalibrated: levels are dBFS, not dB SPL"
msgstr "未校正: レベルは dBFS であり、dB SPL ではありません"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the sweep in the recording runs at {percent:.1f} % of the speed it was g"
"enerated at: the DAW time-stretched it (Warp, Flex Time, Follow Tempo, e"
"lastic audio or a stretch mode). Switch time-stretching off for the swee"
"p clip and measure again"
msgstr ""
"録音内のスイープは生成時の {percent:.1f} % の速さです。DAW がタイムストレッチしました（Warp、Flex Time、Fol"
"low Tempo、elastic audio、またはストレッチモード）。スイープクリップのタイムストレッチをオフにして、もう一度測ってください"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the sweep in the recording runs at {percent:.1f} % of the speed it was g"
"enerated at: a file generated at {generated_hz} Hz was played at {played"
"_hz} Hz without sample-rate conversion (a DAW project at another sample "
"rate that did not convert the file on import). Generate the sweep at the"
" project's sample rate, or let the DAW convert it on import, and measure"
" again"
msgstr ""
"録音内のスイープは生成時の {percent:.1f} % の速さです。{generated_hz} Hz で作ったファイルを {played_"
"hz} Hz で、サンプルレート変換なしに再生しました（別レートの DAW プロジェクトが読み込み時に変換しなかった）。プロジェクトのサンプルレ"
"ートでスイープを作るか、読み込み時に DAW に変換させてから、もう一度測ってください"

